    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A secure plugin to accept Mobile Money and Credit Card payments.</p>\n<p>FeexPay is a plugin designed for Woocommerce that allows you to accept mobile money or credit card payments on your various websites.</p>\n<p>As an advantage, this plugin is very easy to use, intuitive and above all requires no integration costs.</p>\n<p>Using FeexPay is choosing a fast, secure and reliable way to collect online payments.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested with WordPress 7.1 and WooCommerce 11.1.</li>\n<li>Added Congo-Brazzaville (MTN CG) to the country and network settings.</li>\n<li>Added support for the WooCommerce Checkout block.</li>\n<li>Payment confirmation now uses WooCommerce&#8217;s standard flow (processing status, transaction ID, stock reduced only after payment).</li>\n<li>A FeexPay transaction reference can no longer be used to pay more than one order.</li>\n<li>Fixed PHP 8.2+ deprecation notices.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>WordPress 6.8 compatibility.</li>\n<li>FeexPay SDK loaded from CDN (modal.js).</li>\n<li>Fixed sandbox mode always being active.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
